<title>USA: Freshstart hires First Colonial Securities.</title>
<headline>Freshstart hires First Colonial Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freshstart Venture Capital Corp said Friday it retained the investment banking firm First Colonial Securities Group Inc to explore ways to maximize shareholder value.</p>
<p>&quot;Many of the options we have for increasing shareholder value have a capital markets component,&quot; said Freshstart president and chief executive officer Zindel Zelmanovitch.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate further on what options it was considering.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
